## Exact aggregate scope

The front matter is the normative allow-list, and it holds exactly
`REL-SEH-017`'s approved `gates`: **53 work orders, 24 verification contracts
and 58 keyed evidence paths**, over a union of **65 requirements**, measured
on the whole-`gates` basis the contract prescribes (the 51-member historical
basis gives 23 and 64 and is not this record's basis).

