- `WO-ADS-001`, `WO-ADS-002`: `VER-ADS-001`'s Scenario 8 reviewer
  classifications were not run. The pull-request-lane gap is resolved by the
  candidate's own dual-platform runs, green at every head of this branch.
- `WO-IPK-001`: `VREC-IPK-001` binds `6d4a727`, a pull-request merge-preview
  object on no branch; carried as residual risk on the owner's 2026-08-26
  decision.
- `WO-RLS-011`: covered here, not individually; its stale approved prose is
  narrative, and its candidate `f76da57` is an ancestor of the bound commit.
- Every other member's bound verification commit is an ancestor of `374554d`.

## What this record does not do

It is `ready`. It verifies nothing until the assurance owner's decision,
prepares no release record, binds no distribution table, and authorizes no
tag, publication, deployment, maintenance-line mutation, credential use, or
root-evaluator change.

